{"ref":"BDB, מוֹצָא²","hw":"מוֹצָא²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹצָא</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  son of Caleb by Ephah his concubine <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:46\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.46\">1 Ch 2:46</a>, 𝔊 Ιωσα(ν), 𝔊L Μουσα.<br><strong>2.</strong>  a descendant of Saul <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:36\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.36\">1 Ch 8:36</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:37\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.37\">37</a> (𝔊 Μαισα) = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:42\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.42\">9:42</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:43\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.43\">43</a> (𝔊 Μασσα; 𝔊L in both Μωσα).","next":"BDB, מוֹצָאָה","prev":"BDB, מוֹצָא"}